{"path":"locale/toupper","title":"std::toupper(std::locale)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>toupper<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::locale)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/toupper","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Converts the character ch to uppercase if possible, using the conversion rules specified by the given locale's std::ctype facet.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>CharT toupper<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT ch, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts the character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> to uppercase if possible, using the conversion rules specified by the given locale's <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\">std::ctype</a></span> facet.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> loc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> locale\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns the uppercase form of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> if one is listed in the locale, otherwise returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> unchanged.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Only 1:1 character mapping can be performed by this function, e.g. the uppercase form of 'ß' is (with some exceptions) the two-character string \"SS\", which cannot be obtained by <span class=\"t-lc\">std::toupper</span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\nCharT toupper<span class=\"br0\">(</span>CharT ch, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">toupper</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwctype&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es3\">\\u017f</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Latin small letter Long S ('ſ')</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1799\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/showbase\"><span class=\"kw1783\">std::<span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"in the default locale, toupper(\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>c <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\") = \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/toupper\"><span class=\"kw3617\">std::<span class=\"me2\">toupper</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c, <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"in Unicode locale, toupper(\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>c <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\") = \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/toupper\"><span class=\"kw3617\">std::<span class=\"me2\">toupper</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c, <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>in the default locale, toupper(0x17f) = 0x17f\nin Unicode locale, toupper(0x17f) = 0x53</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/tolower\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tolower<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::locale)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a character to lowercase using the <code>ctype</code> facet of a locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/toupper\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>toupper</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a character to uppercase <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/towupper\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>towupper</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a wide character to uppercase <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::toupper(std::locale)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Converts the character ch to uppercase if possible, using the conversion rules specified by the given locale's…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch, loc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns the uppercase form of ch if one is listed in the locale, otherwise returns ch unchanged."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Only 1:1 character mapping can be performed by this function, e.g. the uppercase form of 'ß' is (with some exceptions) the two-character string \"SS\", which…"},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"tolower(std::locale)","note":"converts a character to lowercase using the ctype facet of a locale"},{"label":"toupper","note":"converts a character to uppercase"},{"label":"towupper","note":"converts a wide character to uppercase"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":214,"codeBlockCount":3}
